       class="titleLink"
    >
    <span class="titleNumber">
      § 115-17
    </span>
    <span class="titleTitle"
          data-guid="7680942"
    >
Care of dogs.    </span>
    </a>
  </div>
      </label>
  </div>
                </header>
        <div class="notes" id="notes-7680942" data-guid="7680942"></div>
        <div id="questions-7680942" data-guid="7680942" class="questions"></div>


<div class="section_content content" id="7680942_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="para">All dogs shall be humanely cared for by an Animal Control Officer until they can be reunited with their owner or transported to the appropriate facility.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
                <article>
                <header>
  <div data-component="h2"
       class="contentTitle barTitle sectionTitle 7680943"
      id="7680943"
      data-guid="7680943"
      data-position="2825"
      data-full-title="§ 115-18: Complaint procedure."
      data-code-content-type="section"
  >
    <span class="selectionBox material-icons material-symbols-outlined material-symbols-and-filled md-24"
         title="Select this content"
         aria-label="Select this content"
