       class="titleLink"
    >
    <span class="titleNumber">
      § 115-18
    </span>
    <span class="titleTitle"
          data-guid="7680943"
    >
Complaint procedure.    </span>
    </a>
  </div>
      </label>
  </div>
                </header>
        <div class="notes" id="notes-7680943" data-guid="7680943"></div>
        <div id="questions-7680943" data-guid="7680943" class="questions"></div>


<div class="section_content content" id="7680943_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="para">The Division of Animal Control shall use sound discretion to establish the order of priority for responding to complaints from citizens about dog-related cases.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
                <article>
                <header>
  <div data-component="h2"
       class="contentTitle barTitle sectionTitle 7680944"
