<div class="section_content content" id="7680944_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="para">This article shall supersede any and all the provisions of ordinances, rules or regulations previously enacted or promulgated which are inconsistent with the provisions of this article.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
                <article>
                <header>
  <div data-component="h2"
       class="contentTitle barTitle sectionTitle 7680945"
