<div class="section_content content" id="7680945_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="para">If any provision of this article or its application thereof to any person or circumstance is held invalid, the validity of the remainder of the provisions of this article or Chapter <a class="xref" guid="7680883" href="7680883#7680883">115</a> and the application thereof to other persons and circumstances shall not be affected thereby.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
      </div>
  </div>

